>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LEDGER.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 BALANCE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
01 DIME         PIC 9V99    VALUE 0.10.
01 KEEP-FACTOR  PIC 9V99    VALUE 0.95.
01 EXPECTED     PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 951.14.
01 BAD          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 1000.00.
01 BAD-EXPECTED PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 951.20.
01 I            PIC 99.
01 SHOWN        PIC ZZZZ9.99.
01 BAD-SHOWN    PIC ZZZZ9.99.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PATH.
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 12
        ADD DIME TO BALANCE
    END-PERFORM.
    MULTIPLY KEEP-FACTOR BY BALANCE.
    MOVE BALANCE TO SHOWN.

CONTROL-PATH.
    MULTIPLY KEEP-FACTOR BY BAD.
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 12
        ADD DIME TO BAD
    END-PERFORM.
    MOVE BAD TO BAD-SHOWN.

REPORT.
    IF BALANCE NOT = EXPECTED
        DISPLAY "MAIN " SHOWN " FAIL"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        GOBACK
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "MAIN " SHOWN " PASS".

    IF BAD = BAD-EXPECTED AND BAD NOT = EXPECTED
        DISPLAY "CONTROL " BAD-SHOWN " FAIL"
        MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
        GOBACK
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY "CONTROL DID NOT FAIL " BAD-SHOWN.
    MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE.
    GOBACK.
